  "body": "The [`Bluetooth` page on MDN ](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Bluetooth) says:\r\n\r\n> This feature is non-standard and is not on a standards track\r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/43438/43184722-25455b1c-901c-11e8-8827-8b485eba4222.png)\r\n\r\nIs this (still) accurate? It appears the warning should perhaps be upgraded to [Experimental](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/MDN/Contribute/Guidelines/Conventions_definitions#Experimental)?\r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/43438/43184782-5a9ea66a-901c-11e8-8159-00ca3471eb6e.png)\r\n",
